  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Measure the loin-eye (Longissimus dorsi) area and the subcutaneous fat thickness on B-mode carcass ultrasound images. You calibrate on the image's scale bar, trace an outline and mark two points, either one image at a time or as a coded batch exported to Excel. Data used in the run: stock. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
